This software contains code adapted from the following projects. The adapted files keep a header naming their
origin; the original licenses apply to those parts.

- ByteTrack (https://github.com/FoundationVision/ByteTrack), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 Yifu Zhang.
  Kalman filter, track state, IoU matching, and the two-stage association.
- BoT-SORT (https://github.com/NirAharon/BoT-SORT), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 Nir Aharon.
  ORB global motion compensation (gmc.py, as shipped with McByte and McByte++).
- McByte (https://github.com/tstanczyk95/McByte), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Tomasz Stanczyk.
  ORB camera motion compensation at 1/2 resolution, mask-conditioned association, SAM + Cutie mask adapter.
- McByte++ (https://github.com/tstanczyk95/McBytePlusPlus), Apache License 2.0.
  Conditional ORB camera motion compensation, EdgeTAM mask adapter, online re-identification reconnection.

External packages used at run time (not included): EdgeTAM (Apache-2.0), Segment Anything (Apache-2.0),
Cutie (MIT), deep-person-reid / torchreid (MIT), TrackEval (MIT), PyTorch, OpenCV.
